WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:10.770
You're breaking up with us?

2
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.710
We're not even together, Owen.

3
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.250
Any of us. Just stop being so dramatic.

4
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.040
Is there anything else?

5
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.240
If not, I'm heading to class.

6
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.240
No.

7
00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:41.740
What if...

8
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.700
No.

9
00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.140
I haven't even said anything yet.

10
00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.590
Maybe next time?

11
00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.030
Next time, then.

12
00:00:58.310 --> 00:00:59.210
Okay?

13
00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:07.570
Come on. Lizzie's waiting for us outside.

14
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:11.450
Maybe this time, I'm choosing none of them.

15
00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:13.200
Not because I don't have feelings for them,

16
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.000
but because I've decided not to pursue love
with any of them.

17
00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:20.880
And maybe telling them how I truly feel
is my way of finally finding closure.

18
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:35.850
Number two, don't fall
in love with me, okay?
